<title>FINLAND: Tamro proposes FIM 0.90 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Tamro proposes FIM 0.90 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    0.90 vs 0.70</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   224 vs 155</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.73 vs 1.33</p>
<p> Net sales					 13,220 vs 10,735</p>
<p> Operating profit				   242 vs 181</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish pharmaceuticals wholesaler is Oy Tamro Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
